WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.601 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Welcome to the show, Katie.
-Thanks. This is so cool.

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:04.604 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's very exciting.
This is your first time here.

00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:06.072 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It is.
-Yet your fiancé,

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:07.240 align:start size:94% position:6%
not an actor...
-Beat me.

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:09.075 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...beat you to the punch.
-Beat me to the punch.

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:13.646 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He is a musician, and he was
here playing on the show,

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:14.347 size:81% position:41% line:92%
like, three weeks ago.

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:15.749 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. There he is.
-So, there he is right there.

00:00:15.749 --> 00:00:17.884
-I think you have a closer one.
-Yeah, there you go.

00:00:17.884 --> 00:00:19.185 align:start size:94% position:6%
Here he is playing
with Jordan Davis.

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:20.053 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-And there he is.

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:21.855 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's my handsome fiancé
right there.

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:24.491 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well done. Very, very hunky.
-Yes.

00:00:24.491 --> 00:00:26.893 size:84% position:42%
-Even in the background
that night, I was like,

00:00:26.893 --> 00:00:28.428 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Who is that?!"
-Yes.

00:00:28.428 --> 00:00:28.962 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.962 --> 00:00:31.331 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You guys have a fairly great
engagement story.

00:00:31.331 --> 00:00:35.435 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We do. I knew that
we were going to be spending

00:00:35.435 --> 00:00:36.536 line:92%
a lot of time apart this year,

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:38.271 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause I shoot the show
in Montreal,

00:00:38.271 --> 00:00:41.841 size:84% position:42%
so I decided to plan us
a trip to Switzerland.

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:44.210
-Uh-huh.
-And, so, we went to Switzerland

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:46.679 line:92%
and I'm completely oblivious.

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:50.216 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, he had the ring
in his pocket for days.

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:50.917 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I had no idea.

00:00:50.917 --> 00:00:55.221 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then, he was smart
by letting me plan our day.

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:57.590 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Ah.
-So, I got a list

00:00:57.590 --> 00:00:59.692 align:start size:94% position:6%
of recommendations,
and one of them was a hike

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:03.229 align:start size:94% position:6%
where you take a gondola lift
to the top of the Alps

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:04.364 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then you hike
down to this lake.

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:06.966 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, we were down by the lake,
and I was like,

00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:08.068 size:84% position:42% line:92%
"This is so beautiful."

00:01:08.068 --> 00:01:09.636 align:start size:94% position:6%
There were, like,
the Alps everywhere.

00:01:09.636 --> 00:01:11.771 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he was like "Hey, babe.
What day is it?"

00:01:11.771 --> 00:01:15.241 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like, "I know
he knows it's New Year's Eve."

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:16.342 line:92%
So, I was like, "It's Sunday."

00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:19.579
And I for the past -- we've been
together four and a half years,

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:23.550
I have dropped not so subtle
hints that I wanted him to ask.

00:01:23.550 --> 00:01:24.117 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.117 --> 00:01:27.487 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, so, he was like --
he used to say things like,

00:01:27.487 --> 00:01:28.922
"I'm gonna marry you some day."
And I was like,

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:31.157 align:start size:94% position:6%
"You're gonna marry me
on Sunday?"

00:01:31.157 --> 00:01:33.860 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, so, he asked me
what day it was.

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:34.994 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And it was Sunday.

00:01:34.994 --> 00:01:37.897 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then he reached into
his backpack,

00:01:37.897 --> 00:01:39.766 line:92%
and he pulled out a letter.

00:01:39.766 --> 00:01:41.201 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Now, three years ago,

00:01:41.201 --> 00:01:44.104 align:start size:94% position:6%
he wrote me a stack of letters
for me to open

00:01:44.104 --> 00:01:45.305 line:92%
at times when we were apart.

00:01:45.305 --> 00:01:46.439 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, like,
"Open when you miss me."

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:48.241 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Open me when you are
on the plane to see me."

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:49.175 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my God.
-I know, right?

00:01:49.175 --> 00:01:53.246 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This is -- I apologize to
everybody who is watching this

00:01:53.246 --> 00:01:54.747 line:92%
with their girlfriend tonight.

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:55.415 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.415 --> 00:02:00.153 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And one letter said,
"Do not open until I say so."

00:02:00.153 --> 00:02:01.688 line:92%
So, I am very guilt-ridden.

00:02:01.688 --> 00:02:05.525 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I haven't opened it for
the three years that I had it.

00:02:05.525 --> 00:02:07.227 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so, he pulled it out
at the lake.

00:02:07.227 --> 00:02:10.263 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I opened it, and it said,
"Katie, marry me?"

00:02:10.263 --> 00:02:12.198 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Audience awws ]
-Oh, my God.

00:02:12.198 --> 00:02:15.168 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:15.168 --> 00:02:16.936 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's really awesome.
Congratulations.

00:02:16.936 --> 00:02:17.504 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, thank you.

00:02:17.504 --> 00:02:18.938 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And congrats on the show,
as well.

00:02:18.938 --> 00:02:20.206 line:92%
This is based on Joanna Coles,

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:22.275
who is the Editor in Chief of --
-Yes.

00:02:22.275 --> 00:02:22.909 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Cosmo."
-"Cosmo."

00:02:22.909 --> 00:02:25.145 align:start size:94% position:6%
-She's now
the Chief Content Officer

00:02:25.145 --> 00:02:27.213 line:92%
of Hearst, so she moved up.

00:02:27.213 --> 00:02:27.947 line:92%
-She's an EP on the show.

00:02:27.947 --> 00:02:29.782 size:78% position:39%
What was it like when
you first met her?

00:02:29.782 --> 00:02:33.052 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh, well, I booked the show,
and they were like,

00:02:33.052 --> 00:02:36.022
"You should go to "Cosmo," meet
Joanna, and meet some writers.

00:02:36.022 --> 00:02:40.493 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I had had been to Hearst,
but, like, not really,

00:02:40.493 --> 00:02:42.162 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I didn't really know
my way around.

00:02:42.162 --> 00:02:44.030 align:start size:94% position:6%
But there are these
huge escalators.

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:45.899 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, so, I got to the top
of the escalator,

00:02:45.899 --> 00:02:47.400 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I knew what Joanna
looked like.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:50.370
And, so, I get to the top,
and she was up at the top.

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:54.774
And idiot me, I was like,
"She's here to greet me.

00:02:54.774 --> 00:02:56.009 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:56.009 --> 00:02:58.444 line:92%
She doesn't greet people.

00:02:58.444 --> 00:03:00.980 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, so, she was talking
to somebody,

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:01.948 line:92%
and I was like, "Joanna!"

00:03:01.948 --> 00:03:04.050 align:start size:94% position:6%
And she just went,
[British accent] "Hello."

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:04.584 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.584 --> 00:03:06.219 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Normal voice ] And it
registered what was happening,

00:03:06.219 --> 00:03:08.188 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I was like,
[Gasps] "Oh, my God."

00:03:08.188 --> 00:03:11.624
And I was like, "I'm Katie
on -- on 'The Bold Type.'"

00:03:11.624 --> 00:03:13.960 align:start size:94% position:6%
And she goes,
[British accent] "Oh, Katie.

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:15.228 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is the star
of our new show."

00:03:15.228 --> 00:03:17.263
[ Normal voice ] And then
she brought me up to the office,

00:03:17.263 --> 00:03:20.733
and she would like, carry me
around to like, all the writers,

00:03:20.733 --> 00:03:22.101 align:start size:94% position:6%
the people in
the fashion department,

00:03:22.101 --> 00:03:25.238 align:start size:94% position:6%
but she would carry me there
and then leave me.

00:03:25.238 --> 00:03:26.739 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, it was, like,
she just dropped me off.

00:03:26.739 --> 00:03:28.641
And she was like,
[British accent] "This is Katie.

00:03:28.641 --> 00:03:29.342 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Tell her what you do."

00:03:29.342 --> 00:03:31.978 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Normal voice ] And then
she left to the point where,

00:03:31.978 --> 00:03:34.147 align:start size:94% position:6%
at one point I was like,
"Cool, well,

00:03:34.147 --> 00:03:34.814 size:75% position:38% line:92%
I think I should go.

00:03:34.814 --> 00:03:35.915 align:start size:94% position:6%
Where's Joanna,
so I should say bye?"

00:03:35.915 --> 00:03:38.785
And they were like, "Oh, she
left, like, 30 minutes ago."

00:03:38.785 --> 00:03:40.587 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:40.587 --> 00:03:42.956
-Last thing I want to ask.
You -- you're Portuguese.

00:03:42.956 --> 00:03:44.991 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I am.
-And World Cup going on.

00:03:44.991 --> 00:03:46.759 align:start size:94% position:6%
Are you someone who
is very excited

00:03:46.759 --> 00:03:48.361 line:92%
about Portugal's chances?

00:03:48.361 --> 00:03:49.662 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Força Portugal!

00:03:49.662 --> 00:03:51.030 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:53.399 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Final 16.

00:03:53.399 --> 00:03:54.167 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Cristiano Ronaldo,

00:03:54.167 --> 00:03:56.736 size:81% position:41%
is that somebody that
you have feelings for?

00:03:56.736 --> 00:03:58.304 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, listen.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:58.304 --> 00:04:02.642
I just told a really great story
about my fiancé, otherwise --

00:04:02.642 --> 00:04:03.876 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:03.876 --> 00:04:06.846 align:start size:94% position:6%
I used to say
that I was gonna marry him,

00:04:06.846 --> 00:04:08.381
and he just doesn't know it yet.
-Yeah.

00:04:08.381 --> 00:04:12.118 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And I'm not one for polygamy,
but I could be.

00:04:12.118 --> 00:04:12.885 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:12.885 --> 00:04:14.554 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, let's see if they win
the World Cup.

00:04:14.554 --> 00:04:16.623 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-If they win the World Cup --

00:04:16.623 --> 00:04:17.357 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-If they win, Cristiano,

00:04:17.357 --> 00:04:19.592 align:start size:94% position:6%
I could be your prize.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:19.592 --> 00:04:20.627 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you so much
for being here.

00:04:20.627 --> 00:04:22.295
I really appreciate it.
-Thank you for having me.

00:04:22.295 --> 00:04:24.497 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Give it up for Katie Stevens,
everyone.

